### **五、全局网络策略整合**

#### **1. 端到端安全架构**
```plaintext
# 全网启用IPSec VPN（示例：分支机构互联）
ipsec proposal HQ-Branch
 esp encryption-algorithm aes-256
 esp authentication-algorithm sha512
 quit
ipsec policy VPN-Policy 10
 proposal HQ-Branch
 ike-peer Branch-Office
 quit
```

#### **2. 智能流量调度**
```plaintext
# 定义应用识别（如视频会议）
traffic classifier VideoConf
 if-match application zoom  # 需设备支持深度包检测
 quit
traffic behavior GuaranteedBW
 bandwidth 20%  # 预留带宽
 quit
qos policy Global-QoS
 classifier VideoConf behavior GuaranteedBW
 quit
```

#### **3. 自动化运维**
```plaintext
# 网络健康检查（Python脚本集成）
scheduler job HealthCheck
 python-file flash:/network_monitor.py  # 自定义监控脚本
 quit
scheduler schedule DailyCheck
 job HealthCheck
 time repeating 00:00 to 23:59 interval 60  # 每分钟执行
 quit
```

